ne'>{}</span>", "ja528:58.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja528:58.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja528:59.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja528:59.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja528:59.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja528:59.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja528:60.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja528:61.1": "<p class='endsection'>{}</p>", "ja528:62.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja528:63.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja528:63.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja528:63.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja528:63.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja528:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja528:0.2": "Paṇṇāsanipāta ", "ja528:0.3": "Niḷinikāvagga ", "ja528:0.4": "3. Mahābodhijātaka ", "ja528:1.1": "“Kiṁ nu daṇḍaṁ kimajinaṁ, ", "ja528:1.2": "kiṁ chattaṁ kimupāhanaṁ; ", "ja528:1.3": "Kimaṅkusañca pattañca, ", "ja528:1.4": "saṅghāṭiñcāpi brāhmaṇa; ", "ja528:1.5": "Taramānarūpohāsi, ", "ja528:1.6": "kiṁ nu patthayase disaṁ”. ", "ja528:2.1": "“Dvādasetāni vassāni, ", "ja528:2.2": "vusitāni tavantike; ", "ja528:2.3": "Nābhijānāmi soṇena, ", "ja528:2.4": "piṅgalenābhikūjitaṁ. ", "ja528:3.1": "Svāyaṁ dittova nadati, ", "ja528:3.2": "sukkadāṭhaṁ vidaṁsayaṁ; ", "ja528:3.3": "Tava sutvā sabhariyassa, ", "ja528:3.4": "vītasaddhassa maṁ pati”. ", "ja528:4.1": "“Ahu esa kato doso, ", "ja528:4.2": "yathā bhāsasi brāhmaṇa; ", "ja528:4.3": "Esa bhiyyo pasīdāmi, ", "ja528:4.4": "vasa brāhmaṇa māgamā”. ", "ja528:5.1": "“Sabbaseto pure āsi, ", "ja528:5.2": "tatopi sabalo ahu; ", "ja528:5.3": "Sabbalohitako dāni, ", "ja528:5.4": "kālo pakkamituṁ mama. ", "ja528:6.1": "Abbhantaraṁ pure āsi, ", "ja528:6.2": "tato majjhe tato bahi; ", "ja528:6.3": "Purā niddhamanā hoti, ", "ja528:6.4": "sayameva vajāmahaṁ. ", "ja528:7.1": "Vītasaddhaṁ na seveyya, ", "ja528:7.2": "udapānaṁvanodakaṁ; ", "ja528:7.3": "Sacepi naṁ anukhaṇe, ", "ja528:7.4": "vāri kaddamagandhikaṁ. ", "ja528:8.1": "Pasannameva seveyya, ", "ja528:8.2": "appasannaṁ vivajjaye; ", "ja528:8.3": "Pasannaṁ payirupāseyya, ", "ja528:8.4": "rahadaṁ vudakatthiko. ", "ja528:9.1": "Bhaje bhajantaṁ purisaṁ, ", "ja528:9.2": "abhajantaṁ na bhajjaye; ", "ja528:9.3": "Asappurisadhammo so, ", "ja528:9.4": "yo bhajantaṁ na bhajjati. ", "ja528:10.1": "Yo bhajantaṁ na bhajati, ", "ja528:10.2": "sevamānaṁ na sevati; ", "ja528:10.3": "Sa ve manussapāpiṭṭho, ", "ja528:10.4": "migo sākhassito yathā. ", "ja528:11.1": "Accābhikkhaṇasaṁsaggā, ", "ja528:11.2": "asamosaraṇena ca; ", "ja528:11.3": "Etena mittā jīranti, ", "ja528:11.4": "akāle yācanāya ca. ", "ja528:12.1": "Tasmā nābhikkhaṇaṁ gacche, ", "ja528:12.2": "na ca gacche cirāciraṁ; ", "ja528:12.3": "Kālena yācaṁ yāceyya, ", "ja528:12.4": "evaṁ mittā na jīyare. ", "ja528:13.1": "Aticiraṁ nivāsena, ", "ja528:13.2": "piyo bhavati appiyo; ", "ja528:13.3": "Āmanta kho taṁ gacchāma, ", "ja528:13.4": "purā te homa appiyā”. ", "ja528:14.1": "“Evañce yācamānānaṁ, ", "ja528:14.2": "Añjaliṁ nāvabujjhasi; ", "ja528:14.3": "Paricārakānaṁ sataṁ, ", "ja528:14.4": "Vacanaṁ na karosi no; ", "ja528:14.5": "Evaṁ taṁ abhiyācāma, ", "ja528:14.6": "Puna kayirāsi pariyāyaṁ”. ", "ja528:15.1": "“Evañce no viharataṁ, ", "ja528:15.2": "Antarāyo na hessati; ", "ja528:15.3": "Tuyhaṁ vāpi mahārāja, ", "ja528:15.4": "Mayhaṁ vā raṭṭhavaddhana; ", "ja528:15.5": "Appeva nāma passema, ", "ja528:15.6": "Ahorattānamaccaye. ", "ja528:16.1": "Udīraṇā ce saṅgatyā, ", "ja528:16.2": "bhāvāya manuvattati; ", "ja528:16.3": "Akāmā akaraṇīyaṁ vā, ", "ja528:16.4": "karaṇīyaṁ vāpi kubbati; ", "ja528:16.5": "Akāmākaraṇīyamhi, ", "ja528:16.6": "kvidha pāpena lippati. ", "ja528:17.1": "So ce attho ca dhammo ca, ", "ja528:17.2": "kalyāṇo na ca pāpako; ", "ja528:17.3": "Bhoto ce vacanaṁ saccaṁ, ", "ja528:17.4": "suhato vānaro mayā. ", "ja528:18.1": "Attano ce hi vādassa, ", "ja528:18.2": "aparādhaṁ vijāniyā; ", "ja528:18.3": "Na maṁ tvaṁ garaheyyāsi, ", "ja528:18.4": "bhoto vādo hi tādiso. ", "ja528:19.1": "Issaro sabbalokassa, ", "ja528:19.2": "sace kappeti jīvitaṁ; ", "ja528:19.3": "Iddhiṁ byasanabhāvañca, ", "ja528:19.4": "kammaṁ kalyāṇapāpakaṁ; ", "ja528:19.5": "Niddesakārī puriso, ", "ja528:19.6": "issaro tena lippati. ", "ja528:20.1": "So ce attho ca dhammo ca, ", "ja528:20.2": "kalyāṇo na ca pāpako; ", "ja528:20.3": "Bhoto ce vacanaṁ saccaṁ, ", "ja528:20.4": "suhato vānaro mayā. ", "ja528:21.1": "Attano ce hi vādassa, ", "ja528:21.2": "aparādhaṁ vijāniyā; ", "ja528:21.3": "Na maṁ tvaṁ garaheyyāsi, ", "ja528:21.4": "bhoto vādo hi tādiso. ", "ja528:22.1": "Sace pubbekatahetu, ", "ja528:22.2": "sukhadukkhaṁ nigacchati; ", "ja528:22.3": "Porāṇakaṁ kataṁ pāpaṁ, ", "ja528:22.4": "tameso muccate iṇaṁ; ", "ja528:22.5": "Porāṇakaiṇamokkho, ", "ja528:22.6": "kvidha pāpena lippati. ", "ja528:23.1": "So ce attho ca dhammo ca, ", "ja528:23.2": "kalyāṇo na ca pāpako; ", "ja528:23.3": "Bhoto ce vacanaṁ saccaṁ, ", "ja528:23.4": "suhato vānaro mayā. ", "ja528:24.1": "Attano ce hi vādassa, ", "ja528:24.2": "aparādhaṁ vijāniyā; ", "ja528:24.3": "Na maṁ tvaṁ garaheyyāsi, ", "ja528:24.4": "bhoto vādo hi tādiso. ", "ja528:25.1": "Catunnaṁyevupādāya, ", "ja528:25.2": "rūpaṁ sambhoti pāṇinaṁ; ", "ja528:25.3": "Yato ca rūpaṁ sambhoti, ", "ja528:25.4": "tatthevānupagacchati; ", "ja528:25.5": "Idheva jīvati jīvo, ", "ja528:25.6": "pecca pecca vinassati. ", "ja528:26.1": "Ucchijjati ayaṁ loko, ", "ja528:26.2": "ye bālā ye ca paṇḍitā; ", "ja528:26.3": "Ucchijjamāne lokasmiṁ, ", "ja528:26.4": "kvidha pāpena lippati. ", "ja528:27.1": "So ce attho ca dhammo ca, ", "ja528:27.2": "kalyāṇo na ca pāpako; ", "ja528:27.3": "Bhoto ce vacanaṁ saccaṁ, ", "ja528:27.4": "suhato vānaro mayā. ", "ja528:28.1": "Attano ce hi vādassa, ", "ja528:28.2": "aparādhaṁ vijāniyā; ", "ja528:28.3": "Na maṁ tvaṁ garaheyyāsi, ", "ja528:28.4": "bhoto vādo hi tādiso. ", "ja528:29.1": "Āhu khattavidā loke, ", "ja528:29.2": "bālā paṇḍitamānino; ", "ja528:29.3": "‘Mātaraṁ pitaraṁ haññe, ", "ja528:29.4": "atho jeṭṭhampi bhātaraṁ; ", "ja528:29.5": "Haneyya puttadāre ca, ", "ja528:29.6": "attho ce tādiso siyā’. ", "ja528:30.1": "Yassa rukkhassa chāyāya, ", "ja528:30.2": "nisīdeyya sayeyya vā; ", "ja528:30.3": "Na tassa sākhaṁ bhañjeyya, ", "ja528:30.4": "mittadubbho hi pāpako. ", "ja528:31.1": "Atha atthe samuppanne, ", "ja528:31.2": "samūlamapi abbahe; ", "ja528:31.3": "Attho me sambalenāpi, ", "ja528:31.4": "suhato vānaro mayā. ", "ja528:32.1": "So ce attho ca dhammo ca, ", "ja528:32.2": "kalyāṇo na ca pāpako; ", "ja528:32.3": "Bhoto ce vacanaṁ saccaṁ, ", "ja528:32.4": "suhato vānaro mayā. ", "ja528:33.1": "Attano ce hi vādassa, ", "ja528:33.2": "aparādhaṁ vijāniyā; ", "ja528:33.3": "Na maṁ tvaṁ garaheyyāsi, ", "ja528:33.4": "bhoto vādo hi tādiso. ", "ja528:34.1": "Ahetuvādo puriso, ", "ja528:34.2": "yo ca issarakuttiko; ", "ja528:34.3": "Pubbekatī ca ucchedī, ", "ja528:34.4": "yo ca khattavido naro. ", "ja528:35.1": "Ete asappurisā loke, ", "ja528:35.2": "bālā paṇḍitamānino; ", "ja528:35.3": "Kareyya tādiso pāpaṁ, ", "ja528:35.4": "atho aññampi kāraye; ", "ja528:35.5": "Asappurisasaṁsaggo, ", "ja528:35.6": "dukkhanto kaṭukudrayo. ", "ja528:36.1": "Urabbharūpena vakassu pubbe, ", "ja528:36.2": "Asaṅkito ajayūthaṁ upeti; ", "ja528:36.3": "Hantvā uraṇiṁ ajikaṁ ajañca, ", "ja528:36.4": "Utrāsayitvā yena kāmaṁ paleti. ", "ja528:37.1": "Tathāvidheke samaṇabrāhmaṇāse, ", "ja528:37.2": "Chadanaṁ katvā vañcayanti manusse; ", "ja528:37.3": "Anāsakā thaṇḍilaseyyakā ca, ", "ja528:37.4": "Rajojallaṁ ukkuṭikappadhānaṁ; ", "ja528:37.5": "Pariyāyabhattañca apānakattā, ", "ja528:37.6": "Pāpācārā arahanto vadānā. ", "ja528:38.1": "Ete asappurisā loke, ", "ja528:38.2": "bālā paṇḍitamānino; ", "ja528:38.3": "Kareyya tādiso pāpaṁ, ", "ja528:38.4": "atho aññampi kāraye; ", "ja528:38.5": "Asappurisasaṁsaggo, ", "ja528:38.6": "dukkhanto kaṭukudrayo. ", "ja528:39.1": "Yamāhu natthi vīriyanti, ", "ja528:39.2": "ahetuñca pavadanti ye; ", "ja528:39.3": "Parakāraṁ attakārañca, ", "ja528:39.4": "ye tucchaṁ samavaṇṇayuṁ. ", "ja528:40.1": "Ete asappurisā loke, ", "ja528:40.2": "bālā paṇḍitamānino; ", "ja528:40.3": "Kareyya tādiso pāpaṁ, ", "ja528:40.4": "atho aññampi kāraye; ", "ja528:40.5": "Asappurisasaṁsaggo, ", "ja528:40.6": "dukkhanto kaṭukudrayo. ", "ja528:41.1": "Sace hi vīriyaṁ nāssa, ", "ja528:41.2": "kammaṁ kalyāṇapāpakaṁ; ", "ja528:41.3": "Na bhare vaḍḍhakiṁ rājā, ", "ja528:41.4": "napi yantāni kāraye. ", "ja528:42.1": "Yasmā ca vīriyaṁ atthi, ", "ja528:42.2": "kammaṁ kalyāṇapāpakaṁ; ", "ja528:42.3": "Tasmā yantāni kāreti, ", "ja528:42.4": "rājā bharati vaḍḍhakiṁ. ", "ja528:43.1": "Yadi vassasataṁ devo, ", "ja528:43.2": "na vasse na himaṁ pate; ", "ja528:43.3": "Ucchijjeyya ayaṁ loko, ", "ja528:43.4": "vinasseyya ayaṁ pajā. ", "ja528:44.1": "Yasmā ca vassatī devo, ", "ja528:44.2": "himañcānuphusāyati; ", "ja528:44.3": "Tasmā sassāni paccanti, ", "ja528:44.4": "raṭṭhañca pālite ciraṁ. ", "ja528:45.1": "Gavañce taramānānaṁ, ", "ja528:45.2": "jimhaṁ gacchati puṅgavo; ", "ja528:45.3": "Sabbā tā jimhaṁ gacchanti, ", "ja528:45.4": "nette jimhaṁ gate sati. ", "ja528:46.1": "Evameva manussesu, ", "ja528:46.2": "yo hoti seṭṭhasammato; ", "ja528:46.3": "So ce adhammaṁ carati, ", "ja528:46.4": "pageva itarā pajā; ", "ja528:46.5": "Sabbaṁ raṭṭhaṁ dukhaṁ seti, ", "ja528:46.6": "rājā ce hoti adhammiko. ", "ja528:47.1": "Gavañce taramānānaṁ, ", "ja528:47.2": "ujuṁ gacchati puṅgavo; ", "ja528:47.3": "Sabbā gāvī ujuṁ yanti, ", "ja528:47.4": "nette ujuṁ gate sati. ", "ja528:48.1": "Evameva manussesu, ", "ja528:48.2": "yo hoti seṭṭhasammato; ", "ja528:48.3": "So sace dhammaṁ carati, ", "ja528:48.4": "pageva itarā pajā; ", "ja528:48.5": "Sabbaṁ raṭṭhaṁ sukhaṁ seti, ", "ja528:48.6": "rājā ce hoti dhammiko. ", "ja528:49.1": "Mahārukkhassa phalino, ", "ja528:49.2": "āmaṁ chindati yo phalaṁ; ", "ja528:49.3": "Rasañcassa na jānāti, ", "ja528:49.4": "bījañcassa vinassati. ", "ja528:50.1": "Mahārukkhūpamaṁ raṭṭhaṁ, ", "ja528:50.2": "adhammena pasāsati; ", "ja528:50.3": "Rasañcassa na jānāti, ", "ja528:50.4": "raṭṭhañcassa vinassati. ", "ja528:51.1": "Mahārukkhassa phalino, ", "ja528:51.2": "pakkaṁ chindati yo phalaṁ; ", "ja528:51.3": "Rasañcassa vijānāti, ", "ja528:51.4": "bījañcassa na nassati. ", "ja528:52.1": "Mahārukkhūpamaṁ raṭṭhaṁ, ", "ja528:52.2": "dhammena yo pasāsati; ", "ja528:52.3": "Rasañcassa vijānāti, ", "ja528:52.4": "raṭṭhañcassa na nassati. ", "ja528:53.1": "Yo ca rājā janapadaṁ, ", "ja528:53.2": "adhammena pasāsati; ", "ja528:53.3": "Sabbosadhīhi so rājā, ", "ja528:53.4": "viruddho hoti khattiyo. ", "ja528:54.1": "Tatheva negame hiṁsaṁ, ", "ja528:54.2": "ye yuttā kayavikkaye; ", "ja528:54.3": "Ojadānabalīkāre, ", "ja528:54.4": "sa kosena virujjhati. ", "ja528:55.1": "Pahāravarakhettaññū, ", "ja528:55.2": "saṅgāme katanissame; ", "ja528:55.3": "Ussite hiṁsayaṁ rājā, ", "ja528:55.4": "sa balena virujjhati. ", "ja528:56.1": "Tatheva isayo hiṁsaṁ, ", "ja528:56.2": "saññate brahmacārino; ", "ja528:56.3": "Adhammacārī khattiyo, ", "ja528:56.4": "so saggena virujjhati. ", "ja528:57.1": "Yo ca rājā adhammaṭṭho, ", "ja528:57.2": "bhariyaṁ hanti adūsikaṁ; ", "ja528:57.3": "Luddaṁ pasavate ṭhānaṁ, ", "ja528:57.4": "puttehi ca virujjhati. ", "ja528:58.1": "Dhammaṁ care jānapade, ", "ja528:58.2": "negamesu balesu ca; ", "ja528:58.3": "Isayo ca na hiṁseyya, ", "ja528:58.4": "puttadāre samaṁ care. ", "ja528:59.1": "Sa tādiso bhūmipati, ", "ja528:59.2": "Raṭṭhapālo akodhano; ", "ja528:59.3": "Sapatte sampakampeti, ", "ja528:59.4": "Indova asurādhipo”ti. ", "ja528:60.1": "Mahābodhijātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. ", "ja528:61.1": "Paṇṇāsanipātaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ", "ja528:62.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja528:63.1": "Saniḷīnikamavhayano paṭhamo, ", "ja528:63.2": "Dutiyo pana saummadantivaro; ", "ja528:63.3": "Tatiyo pana bodhisirīvhayano, ", "ja528:63.4": "Kathitā pana tīṇi jinena subhāti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja528:0.1": "", "ja528:0.2": "", "ja528:0.3": "", "ja528:0.4": "", "ja528:1.1": "", "ja528:1.2": "", "ja528:1.3": "", "ja528:1.4": "", "ja528:1.5": "Taramānarūpohāsi → … rūpo gaṇhāsi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja528:1.6": "", "ja528:2.1": "", "ja528:2.2": "", "ja528:2.3": "", "ja528:2.4": "", "ja528:3.1": "", "ja528:3.2": "", "ja528:3.3": "", "ja528:3.4": "", "ja528:4.1": "", "ja528:4.2": "", "ja528:4.3": "", "ja528:4.4": "", "ja528:5.1": "", "ja528:5.2": "", "ja528:5.3": "", "ja528:5.4": "", "ja528:6.1": "", "ja528:6.2": "", "ja528:6.3": "", "ja528:6.4": "", "ja528:7.1": "", "ja528:7.2": "", "ja528:7.3": "", "ja528:7.4": "", "ja528:8.1": "", "ja528:8.2": "", "ja528:8.3": "", "ja528:8.4": "", "ja528:9.1": "", "ja528:9.2": "bhajjaye → bhājaye (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja528:9.3": "", "ja528:9.4": "bhajjati → bhājati (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja528:10.1": "", "ja528:10.2": "", "ja528:10.3": "", "ja528:10.4": "", "ja528:11.1": "", "ja528:11.2": "", "ja528:11.3": "", "ja528:11.4": "", "ja528:12.1": "", "ja528:12.2": "", "ja528:12.3": "", "ja528:12.4": "jīyare → jīrare (sya1ed, pts-vp-pli1); jirare (sya2ed) ", "ja528:13.1": "", "ja528:13.2": "", "ja528:13.3": "", "ja528:13.4": "", "ja528:14.1": "", "ja528:14.2": "", "ja528:14.3": "Paricārakānaṁ sataṁ → paricārakānaṁ sattānaṁ (bj); paricārikānaṁ sattānaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); parivārakānaṁ sattānaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja528:14.4": "", "ja528:14.5": "", "ja528:14.6": "", "ja528:15.1": "", "ja528:15.2": "", "ja528:15.3": "Tuyhaṁ vāpi → tumhañcāpi (bj); tuyhañcāpi (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja528:15.4": "Mayhaṁ vā → amhaṁ vā (bj); mayha vā (sya1ed, sya2ed); mayhañca (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja528:15.5": "", "ja528:15.6": "", "ja528:16.1": "", "ja528:16.2": "", "ja528:16.3": "", "ja528:16.4": "", "ja528:16.5": "", "ja528:16.6": "lippati → limpati (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja528:17.1": "", "ja528:17.2": "", "ja528:17.3": "", "ja528:17.4": "", "ja528:18.1": "", "ja528:18.2": "vijāniyā → vijāniya (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja528:18.3": "", "ja528:18.4": "", "ja528:19.1": "", "ja528:19.2": "sace → ceva (bj); cepi (sya1ed, sya